WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:02.930
"Three years ago..."

00:03.370 --> 00:04.830
Agito!

00:04.830 --> 00:06.860
I'll save Lady Inori...!

00:10.440 --> 00:13.880
Agito! Please save Inori!

00:15.680 --> 00:18.350
Dear brother...

00:18.350 --> 00:20.550
Dear brother, Ibuki...

00:20.550 --> 00:22.880
Look at these treasures!

00:22.880 --> 00:25.450
Did they really leave all these behind?!

00:25.450 --> 00:28.020
The Child of Contract designated as the future king was killed.

00:28.020 --> 00:31.890
Nil Kamui has already lost the spirit to fight.

00:31.890 --> 00:35.200
This war's been going on for seven years now, but it's finally at its end.

00:35.200 --> 00:36.900
Father...

00:36.900 --> 00:38.700
Why did this happen...?

00:43.140 --> 00:46.040
We don't have much time. Get out!

00:46.040 --> 00:49.210
You're the one who said we could take anything in the treasure vault!

00:49.210 --> 00:51.240
This castle is about to...

00:52.280 --> 00:55.450
Hurry it up! Who cares about that old box?!

00:55.450 --> 00:56.980
Yeah, I know!

00:59.420 --> 01:02.060
I'll take this if you don't want it.

01:02.060 --> 01:07.100
This is Nil Kamui's greatest of treasures--the Dragon Eye.

01:07.100 --> 01:10.070
There's supposed to be two of these,

01:10.070 --> 01:14.160
and one was offered to your "spiritual mother" at the start of this war.

01:15.440 --> 01:16.930
Princess...?

01:18.070 --> 01:19.470
You...!

01:19.470 --> 01:22.070
Why... Why did you do that to Father...?!

01:30.850 --> 01:33.760
Pain...? It hurts...

01:33.760 --> 01:36.590
Dear brother, help...

01:36.590 --> 01:38.620
Please, save Inori...

01:43.830 --> 01:47.600
Pledge yourself to me, Imperial.

01:47.600 --> 01:51.510
Bond with me and seek my powers.

01:58.450 --> 02:00.720
I heard Red Dragon's voice.

02:00.720 --> 02:02.720
"Pledge yourself to me..."

02:02.720 --> 02:06.790
I felt like I was waiting all this time to hear those words.

02:06.790 --> 02:09.380
That's why I took the pledge.

02:13.830 --> 02:16.300
"Haiga \ Ka Grava's manor"

02:17.230 --> 02:20.840
What is it you'd like to speak with me about in private, dear brother?

02:20.840 --> 02:23.240
Is it true, Inori?

02:23.240 --> 02:25.340
About Mashiro being a Returned One?

02:25.340 --> 02:29.510
I thought I already said so.
I figured everyone knew already.

02:29.510 --> 02:31.750
Not that!

02:31.750 --> 02:34.350
I'm talking about you being the one that brought her back.

02:34.350 --> 02:38.650
That's the power Red Dragon gave me.

02:38.650 --> 02:41.390
Red Dragon gave you...?

02:41.390 --> 02:45.890
You were given the power to take lives as an aide to the king, dear brother.

02:45.890 --> 02:51.200
I was given the power to bring about life, as the true king.

02:54.940 --> 02:58.170
The name of our country is Nil Kamui.

02:58.170 --> 03:00.180
It's a small island country.

03:00.180 --> 03:05.350
Three years have passed since this country fell to the great country Kouran.

03:05.350 --> 03:12.620
Our ally, D'natia, kept its distance, and our guardian deity, Red Dragon, simply looked on.

03:12.620 --> 03:17.890
I lost everything in this war, called the Seven Year War...

03:17.890 --> 03:23.090
Our castle, my pure body, and even my dear brother, whom I so loved.

03:24.870 --> 03:27.800
Imperial Era 3015, October...

03:27.800 --> 03:31.640
Nil Kamui will soon return to our hands...

03:33.370 --> 03:38.150
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

03:38.150 --> 03:42.580
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

03:42.580 --> 03:44.710
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

03:55.500 --> 04:04.840
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

04:04.840 --> 04:05.840
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

04:05.840 --> 04:07.940
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

04:07.940 --> 04:11.010
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

04:11.010 --> 04:13.250
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

04:13.250 --> 04:15.450
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

04:15.450 --> 04:19.690
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

04:19.690 --> 04:25.930
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

04:25.930 --> 04:31.430
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

04:31.430 --> 04:36.500
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

04:36.500 --> 04:42.180
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

04:42.180 --> 04:47.780
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

04:47.780 --> 04:51.820
<i>The ending world</i>

04:51.820 --> 04:56.690
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

05:03.460 --> 05:06.700
Oh, how unclean!

05:06.700 --> 05:09.370
I can't believe I'm in the same room with a Returned One.

05:09.370 --> 05:13.880
Oh? But, weren't you the one who brought Lady Inori here, Bishop?

05:13.880 --> 05:16.810
I don't have the time to be concerned over her attendant.

05:16.810 --> 05:19.050
Mind your own business!

05:19.050 --> 05:23.690
Agito was the one who sent word saying he found Lady Inori in the first place!

05:23.690 --> 05:26.350
The revolutionary army's Agito?

05:26.350 --> 05:28.490
That's odd.

05:28.490 --> 05:30.360
The revolutionary army's goal

05:30.360 --> 05:35.560
is to chase D'natia and Kouran out and regain independence of the island.

05:35.560 --> 05:40.100
Agito was put in prison as the revolutionary army's leader.

05:40.100 --> 05:43.570
As such, he asked for D'natia to support Lady Inori.

05:43.570 --> 05:48.540
With D'natia supporting the king,
Kouran could be chased out.

05:48.540 --> 05:51.380
Agito would support the king and maintain the revolutionary army.

05:51.380 --> 05:53.050
Both sides win.

05:53.050 --> 05:57.450
But I didn't know Mashiro was a Returned One until now.

05:57.450 --> 06:01.560
I heard that the dragons can revive, even after death.

06:01.560 --> 06:07.060
If so, the creation of a Returned One may demonstrate the power of a dragon.

06:07.060 --> 06:10.790
So then Inori was really chosen by Red Dragon?

06:12.470 --> 06:14.100
Oh, nooo!

06:14.100 --> 06:18.710
Hiding cameras in his own room?

06:18.710 --> 06:21.270
What is he thinking?!

06:22.710 --> 06:24.470
Right?

06:30.220 --> 06:32.650
It doesn't matter whether they hear us or not.

06:32.650 --> 06:35.920
They're all precious companions to me.

06:35.920 --> 06:38.990
Does that apply to Inori, too?

06:38.990 --> 06:42.760
After the castle fell, I was all alone.

06:42.760 --> 06:47.270
I ran, by myself, and even did many things I can't say...

06:47.270 --> 06:48.800
I-I'm sorry...

06:48.800 --> 06:52.940
I'm sorry, Inori... Even after I said
I would always protect you...

06:52.940 --> 06:56.740
The only person I trust is you, dear brother.

06:56.740 --> 06:59.950
It's the same for you with Inori, right?

06:59.950 --> 07:02.420
Don't trust the combined expedition.

07:02.420 --> 07:03.480
Inori...?

07:03.480 --> 07:07.290
Their objective is to destroy Red Dragon.

07:07.290 --> 07:10.530
That way they can gain full control of this island.

07:10.530 --> 07:13.460
Are you going to let that happen, dear brother?!

07:16.530 --> 07:18.500
Ibuki!

07:18.500 --> 07:19.530
Ibuki...

07:19.530 --> 07:21.800
Are the two of you done talking?

07:21.800 --> 07:26.140
Yes. Mashiro really is a Returned One.

07:26.140 --> 07:29.710
So, Inori creating her is...

07:29.710 --> 07:30.950
How absurd!

07:30.950 --> 07:33.780
I don't recall allowing you to do such a thing!

07:33.780 --> 07:35.520
Now come!

07:35.520 --> 07:37.380
I have some words for you...!

07:40.720 --> 07:45.130
I wonder where all that "Lady Inori" treatment from yesterday went...

07:45.130 --> 07:49.360
At day's end, we are simply tools being used to set up D'natia's puppet government.

07:49.360 --> 07:51.630
If you'll excuse me...

07:51.630 --> 07:55.040
So, what are we going to do now?

07:55.040 --> 07:57.240
I will get rid of Mashiro.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.810
No!

07:58.810 --> 08:00.170
Ibuki?

08:00.170 --> 08:03.080
Please, give me some time...

08:03.080 --> 08:05.480
My mind isn't settled yet...

08:09.250 --> 08:11.220
"D'natia embassy"

08:15.760 --> 08:19.890
What...? The contract seal feels like it's burning...

08:21.260 --> 08:23.500
Sir Sweallow...! Sir Sweallow...!

08:23.500 --> 08:25.270
Sir Sweallow!

08:25.270 --> 08:27.500
This is...

08:27.500 --> 08:30.240
Sweallow Clazzvali...

08:30.240 --> 08:32.710
Cursed child...

08:32.710 --> 08:39.010
Your work has shaken Nil Kamui and the land has been colored in black.

08:39.010 --> 08:41.680
That's because of the
Black Dragon Scale's power.

08:41.680 --> 08:46.620
Indeed. Soon Nil Kamui will be painted over in black,

08:46.620 --> 08:50.590
and I will rule that land as if I resided there myself.

08:50.590 --> 08:56.360
Of course, in order to do that, I will need to bring the power of the red one under me.

08:56.360 --> 09:00.540
I will be eagerly waiting for you to bring that about.

09:00.540 --> 09:01.970
One question.

09:01.970 --> 09:05.110
Once the State Magic Territory is overtaken by D'natia,

09:05.110 --> 09:08.210
what will happen to Nil Kamui's citizens?

09:08.210 --> 09:11.080
They will not be decimated.

09:11.080 --> 09:14.380
But they will lose all of their magic.

09:14.380 --> 09:19.920
Twisted beings born from the binding of beasts and humans will come about no more.

09:19.920 --> 09:22.920
I'm assuming that's supposed to be good.

09:22.920 --> 09:25.560
I shall grant you a reward.

09:25.560 --> 09:30.330
I will grant you temporal protection against any blade.

09:30.330 --> 09:33.820
I shall refer to it as the "Black Curtain."

09:40.110 --> 09:41.600
Sir Sweallow!

09:45.310 --> 09:48.920
So... You sensed that, too?

09:48.920 --> 09:50.820
Was it Black Dragon?

09:50.820 --> 09:53.450
But we're in Nil Kamui...

09:53.450 --> 09:57.860
Looks like he really likes me or something...

09:57.860 --> 10:01.130
I think he knows about how
I'm trying to protect Ibuki, too...

10:01.130 --> 10:02.600
It can't be...

10:02.600 --> 10:06.030
Meryl, if you're anxious, then at least you can return...

10:07.940 --> 10:10.130
You good-for-nothing...

10:14.110 --> 10:17.950
Dear brother, please agree with me.

10:17.950 --> 10:22.320
I wasn't planning on becoming D'natia's puppet.

10:22.320 --> 10:27.220
If I rise, then the revolutionary army will rise in revolt as well.

10:27.220 --> 10:29.960
Please, come with me!

10:29.960 --> 10:32.890
What am I supposed to say to the expedition members?

10:32.890 --> 10:36.400
Don't you see? They're our enemies.

10:36.400 --> 10:41.000
First they will need to be killed, or else you will be killed, dear brother.

10:41.000 --> 10:43.700
Lies... She has to be lying...

10:43.700 --> 10:47.010
Oh? Called for my presence, have you?

10:47.010 --> 10:50.880
A child of that one, are you, Imperial?

10:55.820 --> 10:59.550
"Black Dragon Knight \ The order of D'natia's

10:55.820 --> 10:59.550
greatest of soldiers is called the Black

10:55.820 --> 10:59.550
Dragon Knights. This order is comprised

10:55.820 --> 10:59.550
of only those who have directly formed

10:55.820 --> 10:59.550
a contract with Black Dragon, thus forming

10:55.820 --> 10:59.550
a group of formidable warriors."

11:00.690 --> 11:04.390
Red Dragon...?

11:04.390 --> 11:05.730
I didn't call for you!

11:05.730 --> 11:10.930
I am one of the seven dragons associated with Red Dragon, whom you humans revere.

11:10.930 --> 11:15.540
My body is in D'natia, and what you are hearing are my thoughts.

11:15.540 --> 11:17.440
Black Dragon...?

11:18.540 --> 11:23.540
Your wish is to have this island returned to how it once was.

11:23.540 --> 11:26.910
Only D'natia can fulfill that.

11:26.910 --> 11:27.950
What?!

11:27.950 --> 11:32.250
Kouran seeks to dominate this island.

11:32.250 --> 11:35.120
The revolutionary army fights against that.

11:35.120 --> 11:38.890
No matter the outcome, the blood of many will continue to pour.

11:38.890 --> 11:42.400
That is not your wish.

11:42.400 --> 11:45.970
We will not harm the citizens of Nil Kamui.

11:45.970 --> 11:47.940
Side with D'natia...?

11:47.940 --> 11:51.440
That will also save you.

11:51.440 --> 11:56.810
You are troubled with the cursed power you have gained.

11:56.810 --> 11:59.780
Red Dragon's power...

11:59.780 --> 12:03.420
You are aware of what a "State Magic Territory" is, yes?

12:03.420 --> 12:07.960
This island's state is currently shifting greatly towards D'natia.

12:07.960 --> 12:14.660
As a result, Red Dragon will lose its power and you will finally be freed from your curse.

12:14.660 --> 12:17.150
Wait, did Sweallow...?!

12:18.470 --> 12:22.490
It is your choice, Imperial!

12:29.240 --> 12:32.410
D'natia... Kouran...

12:32.410 --> 12:35.180
They all say what they want.

12:35.180 --> 12:39.810
But they don't say anything about what to do with Mashiro...

12:47.160 --> 12:48.830
Where's Mashiro?

12:48.830 --> 12:53.270
That bald geezer came back here all of a sudden.

12:53.270 --> 12:57.860
Something about D'natia interrogating her, and restraining her in the embassy.

12:59.370 --> 13:01.780
Why didn't any of you help her?!

13:01.780 --> 13:06.180
We were told she was Inori's attendant.
That didn't leave us with much of a choice.

13:06.180 --> 13:10.450
Even if she's a Returned One, she's still Mashiro.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.350
You're so kind.

13:13.350 --> 13:17.460
I understand well what it's like to be so fixated on something.

13:17.460 --> 13:21.190
But once something is gone, it will never return to its original form.

13:22.200 --> 13:26.730
It's about time you learned that some things can never be brought back,

13:26.730 --> 13:28.860
and that's what makes them so beautiful.

13:39.810 --> 13:42.020
Ibuki!

13:42.020 --> 13:43.850
Perfect timing!

13:45.520 --> 13:48.350
Sweallow is with D'natia, too...

13:49.820 --> 13:53.520
Huh? Hey, Ibuki!

13:54.530 --> 13:56.900
Hey now, what's going on?

13:56.900 --> 14:00.100
I-I'm sorry, but can you please help me?!

14:02.900 --> 14:04.170
D'natia, eh?

14:04.170 --> 14:06.240
So, interested in chasing young boys' butts or something?

14:06.240 --> 14:09.110
Ah, well, sure, it may look like that, but...

14:09.110 --> 14:11.450
Please deny it more forcefully!

14:11.450 --> 14:16.250
Sorry, but my nature calls me to side with a kid looking for help,

14:16.250 --> 14:18.250
rather than some adult I've never met.

14:18.250 --> 14:19.420
Really?

14:19.420 --> 14:22.220
It's okay, he's a good guy!

14:22.220 --> 14:24.460
That's not what this is about...

14:24.460 --> 14:26.230
Sir Sweallow?

14:26.230 --> 14:27.900
Ulrika?

14:27.900 --> 14:31.370
Ulrika Ledezma? Of the Black Dragon Knights?

14:31.370 --> 14:34.070
You know very well of the peace treaty.

14:34.070 --> 14:35.400
So, what are you...

14:35.400 --> 14:38.540
Ah, wait... He's a good guy, and...

14:38.540 --> 14:41.380
We don't know that for sure.

14:41.380 --> 14:42.480
Sir Byakuei!

14:42.480 --> 14:44.210
Where are you?!

14:44.210 --> 14:45.780
Hey, over here!

14:45.780 --> 14:47.650
I got lost in the crowd!

14:48.980 --> 14:50.120
Byakuei...?

14:50.120 --> 14:51.220
Could it be...?

14:51.220 --> 14:53.420
Apologies for not introducing myself earlier.

14:53.420 --> 14:55.390
As the new representative of Kouran,

14:55.390 --> 15:00.790
I'm on my way to Fort Rosweisse to speak with the Black Dragon Knights.

15:00.790 --> 15:02.630
Huh? So then he's...

15:02.630 --> 15:04.770
...the Leader of Ten Thousand, Sir Byakuei.

15:04.770 --> 15:09.900
And if so, he's one of the six great generals of Kouran's force.

15:10.970 --> 15:12.740
I want to meet Enumael!

15:12.740 --> 15:15.740
By order of the Bishop, we are not to allow anyone through!

15:13.470 --> 15:15.440
"D'natia embassy"

15:16.740 --> 15:17.810
Move!

15:17.810 --> 15:20.910
Do not get in the way of an Imperial of Nil Kamui!

15:22.280 --> 15:23.280
Mashiro!

15:23.280 --> 15:25.480
Where are you, Mashiro?!

15:29.960 --> 15:32.360
Ka Grava's so hilarious!

15:32.360 --> 15:35.090
Seriously, he hid way too many wiretaps.

15:36.500 --> 15:38.700
Mashiro should have been brought here.

15:38.700 --> 15:40.940
Ah... Don't worry.

15:40.940 --> 15:42.770
What do you mean "don't worry"?!

15:42.770 --> 15:45.710
Bishop Enumael wants to make you the king, right?

15:45.710 --> 15:49.780
There's no way he would allow a
Returned One to stay at your side!

15:49.780 --> 15:55.320
Even if Enumael kills her,
I'll just revive her again.

15:55.320 --> 15:59.520
So feel free to use that power of yours, dear brother.

15:59.520 --> 16:01.190
Ah, that's right!

16:01.190 --> 16:04.450
How about we burn that girl, Lou?

16:05.660 --> 16:10.500
She wields a sword that prevents
Returned Ones from reviving again.

16:11.830 --> 16:17.570
Besides, I wanted to see your power that you got from Red Dragon, dear brother.

16:17.570 --> 16:20.740
I won't use that power ever again.

16:20.740 --> 16:25.150
Besides, if Lou dies, Ka Grava and Sweallow won't let that go.

16:25.150 --> 16:27.920
Then we should just kill them, too.

16:27.920 --> 16:32.750
The expedition is merely a means to kill Red Dragon anyways.

16:32.750 --> 16:37.260
Ah, but if there's someone you particularly like,
I can bring them back to life later.

16:37.260 --> 16:39.190
Inori...

16:39.190 --> 16:41.750
I've done enough of that already...

16:43.200 --> 16:45.070
I see...

16:45.070 --> 16:52.000
You're clearing my anger and sorrow in my place, aren't you, Red Dragon...?

16:53.010 --> 16:54.340
More...

16:54.340 --> 16:56.010
Even more...

16:56.010 --> 16:58.850
Destroy more... Burn more...

16:58.850 --> 17:02.620
Bring more upon those who took everything from me and those who live on idly!

17:02.620 --> 17:07.390
All who have directed their wrath towards us will be incinerated!

17:07.390 --> 17:10.260
And then, if we bring only those we like back as Returned Ones,

17:10.260 --> 17:13.290
a world that is kind to us will be born.

17:13.290 --> 17:16.090
That will be our new Nil Kamui.

17:17.100 --> 17:21.400
She thinks Red Dragon went on a rampage for her...

17:21.400 --> 17:25.640
Is Red Dragon's madness controlling Inori, too?

17:25.640 --> 17:30.240
At this rate, Inori really will kill everyone...

17:31.750 --> 17:33.780
I understand, Inori.

17:33.780 --> 17:36.420
But let's first go and meet Agito.

17:36.420 --> 17:37.550
Huh?

17:37.550 --> 17:40.120
We'll officially place you upon the throne.

17:40.120 --> 17:44.790
Since D'natia won't support us any more, we need to get Agito out of Shuka's prison.

17:44.790 --> 17:49.230
I'm so happy, dear brother!
So, you will come with me?

17:49.230 --> 17:50.750
Of course!

17:52.430 --> 17:56.970
I've been protected by everyone in the expedition until now.

17:56.970 --> 18:00.240
Lou even lost one of her arms...

18:00.240 --> 18:04.510
I won't let anyone harm them, ever...!

18:13.690 --> 18:15.250
Don't come in, Ibuki!

18:16.860 --> 18:19.160
What's going on here?

18:19.160 --> 18:20.680
Mashiro...?

18:33.970 --> 18:36.440
Dinner is ready.

18:36.440 --> 18:37.540
Sir Ibuki?

18:37.540 --> 18:40.180
Ibuki hasn't returned yet?

18:40.180 --> 18:42.210
It would seem that way.

18:43.050 --> 18:46.020
"Haiga outskirts"

18:45.290 --> 18:48.560
Fugaku, what happened?

18:48.560 --> 18:51.530
It was... a horrible sight.

18:51.530 --> 18:54.960
Enumael kept haranguing us in front of Mashiro.

18:54.960 --> 19:00.160
He cried heresy, called us savages, and pressed to have Mashiro exterminated.

19:01.470 --> 19:06.410
The commotion apparently stirred Mashiro, and...

19:38.370 --> 19:40.430
S-Stop...!

19:42.710 --> 19:44.370
Holy spirit, appear!

19:53.420 --> 19:58.860
Lady Inori watched in silence until the bishop stopped moving.

19:58.860 --> 20:02.800
Dear brother, let's go to Shuka!

20:02.800 --> 20:04.900
Before that... Mashiro...

20:04.900 --> 20:07.070
If you want to speak with her, we'll have time later...

20:07.070 --> 20:09.540
Ibuki, what are you doing?!

20:09.540 --> 20:11.030
Dear brother...?!

20:17.610 --> 20:19.650
Dear brother...

20:19.650 --> 20:22.050
She won't die from that.

20:22.050 --> 20:23.880
And...

20:23.880 --> 20:25.380
Red Dragon...

20:26.390 --> 20:32.450
Red Dragon, you mentioned that a
Returned One can be taken as an offering.

20:33.960 --> 20:38.330
I will offer my dear Mashiro again.

20:38.330 --> 20:41.000
Even if she is a Returned One, her life is still precious.

20:41.000 --> 20:42.740
Isn't that so?!

20:42.740 --> 20:44.570
Indeed.

20:44.570 --> 20:47.340
I will accept her as an equivalent exchange.

20:47.340 --> 20:48.410
You're not thinking of...!

20:48.410 --> 20:51.740
In the name of the Child of Contract, and of Red Dragon...

20:54.350 --> 21:02.350
...incinerate every bit of Mashiro's soul so that she will never rise again!

21:21.510 --> 21:23.280
Mashiro...

21:23.280 --> 21:27.010
Do you remember what you told me...?

21:27.010 --> 21:29.880
...please be a good king...

21:31.290 --> 21:33.550
I•••

21:33.550 --> 21:35.610
...haven't forgotten...

21:45.970 --> 21:46.400
"Act 9"

21:47.370 --> 21:50.670
"Act 9 \ Winding"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.900 --> 23:30.170
Act 10: "Narrow Escape from Death."

23:26.970 --> 23:27.430
"Act 10"

23:30.170 --> 23:36.580
Qi Sha Tian Ling's lustful sight pierces the ever hopeful Ulrika.

23:36.580 --> 23:40.950
The spirit's divine protection glimmers within the darkness of despair.
